    "body": "Hi Mark 👋 \r\n\r\n> The Homebrew install has no starship binary in any of the normally used directories, such as /usr/local/bin.\r\n\r\nCorrect. Homebrew usually has its own installation directory which needs to be separately sourced.\r\n\r\nThe path of the starship binary should be the output of `$(brew --prefix)/bin/starship`.\r\nYou can try running `brew doctor` to troubleshoot your installation if you're still running into unexpected behavior after extending your path to add brew's bin directory.",
